      "source": "<a href=\"../../autoconfigure/EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>Auto-configuration</code></a> for\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/rsocket/RSocketRequester.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.rsocket\"><code>RSocketRequester</code></a>. This auto-configuration\ncreates <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/rsocket/RSocketRequester.Builder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.rsocket\"><code>RSocketRequester.Builder</code></a>\nprototype beans, as the builders are stateful and should not be reused to build\nrequester instances with different configurations.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../autoconfigure/EnableAutoConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure\"><code>自动配置</code></a> 用于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/rsocket/RSocketRequester.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.rsocket\"><code>RSocketRequester</code></a>。此自动配置创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/rsocket/RSocketRequester.Builder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.rsocket\"><code>RSocketRequester.Builder</code></a> 原型 Bean，因为构建器是有状态的，不应重复使用它们来构建具有不同配置的请求器实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
